Comment: 0,0:01:24.35,0:01:26.89,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:23:00.42,0:23:12.93,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ending}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:28.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi, it's fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:29.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's the smell of fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.85,0:00:32.09,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Smell of fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.09,0:00:33.05,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What's that smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.48,0:00:36.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's a little bit smokey and a little bit sunny,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:39.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,and makes your heart feel kinda refreshed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:41.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,or makes your chest feels tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:44.51,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's a smell that makes you feel nostalgic somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.11,0:00:48.48,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You know what fall smells like even though you don't have memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:49.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:50.96,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:53.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.84,0:01:18.13,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Woah, amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:03:00.91,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's the first time I've ever seen such a magnificent ginkgo tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.91,0:03:04.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It really is fall, isn't it, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:10.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter? You look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.95,0:03:13.70,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.70,0:03:14.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.33,0:03:17.50,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Look at this. Do you know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.08,0:03:24.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... When it turns fall, the leaves make themselves pretty and do the dance of the wind—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:27.27,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Who told you to make up little fantasy stories?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.61,0:03:30.98,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! What's your wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:33.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:37.99,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You can't possibly have forgotten, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:41.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,T-To get to the place I want to go to!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.36,0:03:46.99,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And to make that wish come true, what do you have to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:50.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... gather konpeito!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:53.28,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And what do you have to do in order to gather konpeito?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.78,0:03:56.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Heal people's wounded hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:03:58.58,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,How long do you have to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:00.91,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Four seasons!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.91,0:04:02.02,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And how many seasons are left?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.02,0:04:03.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:05.72,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,How many have you gathered so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.72,0:04:10.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... about this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.31,0:04:13.20,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:14.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:19.40,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You know where this place you want to go is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:24.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.72,0:04:26.70,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:32.33,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful! Your hat was about to fly off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.92,0:04:34.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:37.03,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.13,0:04:43.05,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morn— Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.05,0:04:46.18,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever! I hate you, Toshihiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:50.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter? You shouldn't say things like "I hate you"!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:54.48,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru and Toshihiko were\Nhaving a fight over the blocks...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:05:00.62,Default,Yuruzu,0000,0000,0000,,I can't make my train without a triangle piece and Toshihiko's using two of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.62,0:05:03.78,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Because you get a square if you put two of them together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.43,0:05:07.30,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are there no more square pieces?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.30,0:05:08.03,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:14.35,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,T-Then let's all make\Nsomething big together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.35,0:05:15.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Like a castle or—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:16.02,Default,Yuruzu,0000,0000,0000,,No, forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.91,0:05:27.98,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you guys aren't going to value this, then you won't be allowed to play with it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.29,0:05:33.53,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, doesn't matter. They're boring toys anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.53,0:05:37.80,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. They're old and dirty, we\Nmight as well just throw them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:43.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto! You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.13,0:05:56.91,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,I don't like it when Mister Kiyokazu's angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:18.20,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.20,0:06:18.62,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,He—!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:23.67,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:25.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:29.95,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That was Ioryogi's voice, but Ioryogi isn't here...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:31.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:32.37,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you an idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:34.93,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be all sad and sullen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.93,0:06:38.00,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think you can gather konpeito like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.95,0:06:40.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:41.89,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.49,0:06:44.37,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.56,0:06:49.70,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto just left for his part-time job, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:51.86,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.86,0:06:55.03,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't even say he was\Nleaving; it was really unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.03,0:06:56.05,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.36,0:06:58.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.15,0:07:01.03,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:07.68,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I see. So that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:13.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's face wasn't an angry one... it was sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.69,0:07:16.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't even notice that, and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.27,0:07:20.52,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You're not at fault here, Kobato. And neither is Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.95,0:07:24.61,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,The children have to use such old toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.61,0:07:28.75,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be nice if we could gather some more new toys for them, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:31.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Toys...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.71,0:07:34.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I got it! If toys are the problem,\NI know a nice place we could go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:37.07,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,A nice place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.91,0:07:43.52,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, were are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:44.95,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Someplace fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.09,0:07:47.37,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.37,0:07:49.32,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.32,0:07:51.12,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,A giant tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.29,0:07:56.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Today, we're going to gather the fallen leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:08:00.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And then when we get back, we're going to use those leaves to draw pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:02.21,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Draw pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:05.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There are leaves of all different shapes and colors, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.65,0:08:09.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what sorts of pictures we could draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:12.99,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,I'll gather leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.99,0:08:13.33,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.47,0:08:28.89,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka, look it! I found a pretty leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.16,0:08:32.21,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,It's for you, Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.21,0:08:33.66,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,And for you too, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:35.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.59,0:08:38.98,Default,Boys,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.59,0:08:38.98,Default Alt,Boys,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.06,0:08:42.77,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:44.19,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,About the building blocks...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:48.95,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Can you two promise to treat them well from now on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.67,0:08:50.22,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:51.45,Default,Yuruzu,0000,0000,0000,,I'll use them carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.95,0:08:52.78,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,And also...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.12,0:08:56.29,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,There's something that needs to be said after a fight, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.27,0:08:59.28,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:00.52,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.55,0:09:03.89,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Be sure to apologize to Fujimoto later as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.89,0:09:04.39,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.39,0:09:07.34,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give Mister Fujimoto a bunch of leaves too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:13.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm so glad they were able to make up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:18.59,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Normally, they almost never get into fights...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.59,0:09:22.05,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I guess our adult worries\Nwere carried over to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:24.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That won't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.08,0:09:26.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You look best with a smile on your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.29,0:09:30.54,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:33.76,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,If I look so gloomy, even happiness\Nwould run away from me, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:36.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right! Smiles are they key, smiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.96,0:09:51.08,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It's amazing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.08,0:09:53.30,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like light caught on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:54.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.75,0:10:07.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It gives me a beautiful,\Nsomehow really serene feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.01,0:10:25.18,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.18,0:10:26.11,Default,Man2,0000,0000,0000,,It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.93,0:10:32.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me, what's going to happen here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:36.95,Default,Man3,0000,0000,0000,,We came to put up a fence today.\NWe're cutting that tree down tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:40.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,When you say cut down...\NDo you mean this ginkgo tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.99,0:10:41.89,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:43.33,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.07,0:10:47.00,Default,Man3,0000,0000,0000,,We've gotten complaints from the residents of this neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:49.17,Default,Man3,0000,0000,0000,,They say, "It's annoying, please do something about that tree."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.17,0:10:50.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.38,0:10:52.32,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Even though it's so beautiful and magnificent...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:55.99,Default,Man3,0000,0000,0000,,The problem is that it's too magnificent,\Nso its fallen leaves are a pain to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.99,0:10:58.80,Default,Man3,0000,0000,0000,,Well, redevelopment construction has started already and all...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.91,0:11:03.35,Default,Man3,0000,0000,0000,,Please move out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:17.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:18.16,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:21.03,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What's redevelopment?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.03,0:11:26.43,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It means to break down old things, like\Nstreets or buildings, and build up new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:30.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's... what's meant by redevelopment?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.21,0:11:30.66,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.45,0:11:38.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Does that mean old things are\Nuseless then, or unneeded?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.79,0:11:40.99,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't mean all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:46.58,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But truth is, there are a lot more humans who appreciate new things over old, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.33,0:12:20.80,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, the Nursery isn't open this early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:22.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to try asking them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:24.22,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:27.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,To please not cut down the ginkgo tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.05,0:12:29.48,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:30.76,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.80,0:12:34.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If I ask them, I'm sure—!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:51.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:58.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato, Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.66,0:13:03.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Were you also worried about this ginkgo tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:04.57,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.57,0:13:07.88,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Old things are in trouble\Nbecause of redevelopment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:09.37,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.37,0:13:12.95,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm going to ask them sincerely, so I'm sure everything will be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.95,0:13:14.64,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:17.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I have no idea what's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.34,0:13:23.27,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, this fence wasn't here yet yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.91,0:13:26.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's supposedly because of redevelopment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:30.61,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Well, there's always been talk of that I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.98,0:13:33.62,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,It's a magnificent ginkgo tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:37.42,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,but for the sake of bettering our town, I guess there's no other way but to cut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.41,0:13:43.72,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:46.74,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,But redevelopment, that'll be a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:51.52,Default,Misses,0000,0000,0000,,Has this humongous tree always been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.52,0:13:54.43,Default,Mister,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it kind of disturbing for a tree to be that big?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.43,0:13:55.71,Default,Misses,0000,0000,0000,,You could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.71,0:13:59.19,Default,Misses,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no! Look at the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:03.28,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.28,0:14:04.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:07.91,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You're unhappy, aren't you? That everyone's saying things like that tree is unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:09.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:10.87,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.10,0:14:14.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The ginkgo tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.37,0:14:15.88,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,must be so lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:17.29,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:23.79,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's been here for tens of years, hundreds of years, watching over this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.79,0:14:28.05,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,and yet no one stops to think about it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.22,0:15:02.10,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:05.79,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,It says it's not lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.73,0:15:11.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You can understand it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.33,0:15:13.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Understand what the tree is thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:15.55,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.55,0:15:20.06,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,She might be lazing around now, but Kohaku was once an angel after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.54,0:15:23.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, what else does the tree say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:26.58,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.58,0:15:31.58,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It had fun yesterday when so\Nmany little people came to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.58,0:15:40.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything else we could do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.62,0:15:45.62,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,It says thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:46.68,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,And also...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.29,0:15:49.63,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:55.35,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, it'll be okay! I'll ask them not to cut you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.23,0:16:06.35,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Somehow, it doesn't seem to wish for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.11,0:16:11.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll... move you somewhere else!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.97,0:16:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.74,0:16:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.40,0:16:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.91,0:16:26.20,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, how unreasonable are you going to be about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.20,0:16:27.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.16,0:16:34.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But, but if I don't, it'll... it'll!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:46.58,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I know a wisteria tree who has lived\Nfor about as long as this ginkgo tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.55,0:16:54.64,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,It also said the same things as this ginkgo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.47,0:16:56.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The same things?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.50,0:16:59.12,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,To be able to be here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:03.86,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,and watch over the people it loves brings it the most happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.51,0:17:20.38,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Can you hear the ginkgo tree's song?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.35,0:17:27.88,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.88,0:17:32.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's a little heart-rending, but very gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.69,0:17:56.73,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Fall is by the waterfront, winter is hidden in the tips of branches.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.73,0:18:09.43,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}There is limitless kindness in the depth of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.89,0:18:21.95,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Each time night falls, let us offer up a prayer
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:36.01,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}so we can welcome each coming day with peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.15,0:18:49.89,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Guide me, O voice, so far, far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.28,0:18:54.09,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Like smiles...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.09,0:18:57.11,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Like songs...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.11,0:19:03.28,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}The resonating sound of the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:09.84,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Happiness or sadness,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:16.30,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'll embrace all of it and continue walking forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:19.94,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}They are what so strongly connect
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.94,0:19:30.55,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}my hands to yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.29,0:20:12.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The ginkgo tree—!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.59,0:20:14.07,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That was dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.07,0:20:16.01,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Why were you just standing there looking confused?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.01,0:20:17.62,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.37,0:20:22.00,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It was its time, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.00,0:20:23.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.19,0:20:25.72,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,The middle is hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:28.71,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Sooner or later, it was going to wither and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.68,0:20:36.54,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,You tried your hardest to hold on as long as you could, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:43.80,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku, was the ginkgo tree happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:45.60,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:46.99,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I'm sure it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.90,0:20:52.77,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, it was able to be\Ncarried off on your song, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.03,0:21:05.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.10,0:21:05.69,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.46,0:21:09.95,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder who this konpeito could be from.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.60,0:21:12.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be Kohaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.26,0:21:14.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But it doesn't seem like it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.23,0:21:15.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.61,0:21:17.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But that's not possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.55,0:21:19.37,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It might be from that ginkgo tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.37,0:21:20.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:23.24,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Even plants and trees have souls, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.24,0:21:26.92,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you heal that soul, then it's not so strange that this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.54,0:21:31.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I wasn't able to save the ginkgo tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.21,0:21:33.25,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You sang, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.25,0:21:34.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sang?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.52,0:21:36.76,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's like Kohaku said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.76,0:21:40.64,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,"It was able to be carried off on your song."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.64,0:21:43.49,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It must have been really\Nhappy at its end, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.65,0:21:46.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:56.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,How does it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.14,0:22:02.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, won't you join us too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.71,0:22:03.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.86,0:22:05.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.85,0:22:11.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.39,0:22:12.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A building block, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.76,0:22:15.59,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I made it out of the branches of the ginkgo tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.95,0:22:18.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Out of the ginkgo tree's...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.04,0:22:24.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing! This is amazing, Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.87,0:22:26.29,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:30.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, Fujimoto made building blocks for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:40.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko, Yuzuku? What do you have to say to Fujimoto before playing with the blocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.85,0:22:44.96,Default,Boys,0000,0000,0000,,Mister Kiyokazu, we're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.96,0:22:45.85,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I-It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.85,0:22:48.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so glad! Everyone's made up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.67,0:22:50.94,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey, Mister Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.94,0:22:52.31,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Let's play leaf pictures together!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.31,0:22:53.19,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's okay. I—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.19,0:22:56.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If you stick ginkgo leaves on him, you get a Ginkgofujimotian!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.62,0:22:57.59,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,...what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:32.04,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.04,0:01:39.71,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.28,0:01:34.89,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.18,0:01:39.48,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:43.49,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:46.29,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.56,0:01:53.63,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:59.21,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday,\Nyour dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:03.05,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.22,0:02:06.59,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:09.65,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:12.39,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:17.64,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:20.45,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.46,0:02:24.04,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.07,0:02:26.80,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:29.54,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.77,0:02:36.42,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.71,0:02:40.43,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:45.08,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
